clevo-cc-linux (0.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add an optional Electron shell alongside Tauri 2, sharing the same React
    frontend and Rust backend commands (for hosts where WebKitGTK fails on the
    NVIDIA proprietary driver).
  * Make the UI backend shell-agnostic: a headless build exposes a localhost
    HTTP bridge (`--serve`) the Electron main process proxies.
  * Release the Electron renderer when the window is closed, keeping the tray
    and backend alive.

 -- clevo-cc-linux  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

