clevo-cc-linux (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix NVIDIA exit crash (core dump on every close) by moving Skia to CPU.
  * Close the window to the tray instead of quitting.
  * Refresh the tray performance-mode menu after a switch.
  * Fill a 16:10 window without black bands; honour the ratio in the design
    surface and raise the scale ceiling so 4K presets fill the screen too.

 -- clevo-cc-linux  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

